        {
          "id": 506538560,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "While it is offset by 36 bytes from the start of CM private data and those 36 bytes are used by standard RDMA-CM header.\n\nNVMEoF CM Private payload is aligned with RDMA-CM private data, and this is what we are trying to decode.\n\nAre you suggesting to fix the comment?",
          "author": {
            "id": 8151300,
            "username": "constg2021",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Constantine Gavrilov",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3e14dae3452c6729ef51dfff170770b32fcab39df75873fde50fce93c6d61b49?s=80&d=identicon",
