        {
          "id": 506552425,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I have checked the infiniband dissector. If it sees RDMA CM payload, in CM private data (36 bytes), it will dissect it, and move the position 36 bytes.\n\nSo, all protocols that register for \"infiniband.mad.cm.private\", will get RDMA-CM private data, and not CM private data.\n\nI am updating the comment.",
          "author": {
            "id": 8151300,
            "username": "constg2021",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Constantine Gavrilov",
            "state": "active",
